  "description": "These Stocks on the Screener Looked JUICY 🤤",
  "body_html": "<p>Apologies for what may be my worst video of all time. My kids took over the office and my house was a zoo. I went to my truck to record quickly and get the information out. </p><p>Regardless, these 4 stocks from the StockTok screener earlier today looked very impressive, with accumulation periods, breakouts and most of them having bullish formations such as Volatility Contraction Patterns. These were bought during post-market…which means limit orders are used.  </p><p>If you don’t see this post until later, and wondering whether its still good or not (not that there is any guarantee these will go to the moon….we use risk management for a reason)…if price is still within +/- 5% of my entries, I will most likely automatically say yes. You are also welcome to ping me in the chat if you have questions. </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p>The 4 stocks are: </p>",
